        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg_2. t3" value="Guard, redaction, failure path" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="leg_2. ">
          <mxGeometry x="54" y="102" width="266" height="20" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2note" value="Cost shape of one run (measured on the CSIC gateway)&#xa;&#xa;• LLM calls per run ≈ 2 (triage + planner) + one per search task (≈12–45) + one per interpretation batch (3, or ~14 in cluster mode)&#xa;   + 1 synthesis + ~1 top-up + one per cited paper (quotes, ~25) + one per citation per verify round (≈25 x up to 3) + up to 2 rewrites.&#xa;   The two fan-outs — quote collection and citation verification — dominate the call count; interpretation dominates wall-clock.&#xa;• Every call is streamed, because a non-streamed generation on this gateway is abandoned at ~120 s per attempt (HTTP 408 after ~490 s).&#xa;• Nested time limits: 45 s straggler cutoff on verifier calls, 180 s per stream read, 600 s per long-form call, 2700 s for the whole run.&#xa;• Cluster mode widens the subject matter (~100 pathways instead of 15) and pays for it with more, smaller batches, most of them single-shot." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="1590" width="1030" height="190" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
